2.  **Test Thoroughly:** Test with various models (Gemini, Mistral, etc.) and with and without files to ensure everything works correctly.  Pay close attention to the error handling.  Test with invalid inputs and network interruptions.

This improved version addresses the core issue, handles errors robustly, and improves efficiency by using the debounced save. It also aligns your frontend message handling with your backend's response structure. Remember to always check your browser's developer console for detailed error messages. This revised code provides a much more reliable and robust solution.

